; PARSE-4: a space between two digits is a digit-group separator inside a
; posting amount, not the end of the number. (numbers-space-groups.journal
; covers the same separator in a `commodity` directive.)
2017-01-01
    a    1 000.00 EUR
    b   -1 000.00 EUR

2017-01-02
    a    1 000 000.00 SEK
    b   -1 000 000.00 SEK
